# Note # {#note}

 <p>The Sanitizer API has been moved to <a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#html-sanitization">WHATWG HTML</a>.

## Issue Reporting ## {#issues}
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues">File specification issues in the WHATWG HTML issue tracker</a>.</li>
<li>Please report bugs in implementations to the corresponding browser vendor. We encourage you to look into their security reporting policies.</li>
